@startuml 01-system-context-as-is

' Model: As-Is
' UE baseline: dead903156946ec6956342f02d587612baab1717
' AI service baseline: f548c1ad64c5d284eace084132616d171d45403f
' Evidence: DOC-GDD-001, UE-CMD-001, UE-CHAT-001, UE-AUTH-001,
'           PY-APP-001, PY-API-CMD-001, PY-API-VOICE-001,
'           PY-API-TACTICAL-001, PY-API-CHAT-001

title Aesir Combat Prototype — 系统上下文（As-Is）

skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAF7
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #F8E7C4
  BorderColor #8A5A20
  FontColor #422006
}
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #E8F0FE
  BorderColor #315A93
  FontColor #172554
}
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #E8F0FE
  BorderColor #315A93
  FontColor #172554
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #EAF5EA
  BorderColor #3C7650
  FontColor #183B24
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8DB
  BorderColor #9A7B16
  FontColor #3F3308
}

left to right direction

actor "玩家\n[DOC-GDD-001]" as Player

rectangle "**Unreal Engine 5.8 客户端**\nAesir Combat Prototype\n\n采集输入并展示反馈\n权威校验、战斗结算和 AI 行为执行\n[UE-AUTH-001] [UE-AI-001] [UE-CMD-001] [UE-CHAT-001]" as UE

rectangle "**Python AI 服务**\nFastAPI\n\n语音转写、命令理解、上下文战术决策\n生成受限 JSON 和人设化回复\n[PY-APP-001] [PY-PARSER-001] [PY-TACTICAL-001]" as PythonService

database "本地配置与运行数据\nYAML / Golden JSON / JSONL\n[PY-DATA-001]" as LocalData

Player -right-> UE : 操作、文字或语音输入\n以及战斗、HUD 与同伴反馈

UE -right-> PythonService : HTTP 请求 / JSON 响应\n/health\n/v1/commands/parse\n/v1/voice/command\n/v1/tactical/resolve\n/v1/companion/chat
PythonService -right-> LocalData : 读取 YAML / Golden JSON\n写入运行时 JSONL

note bottom of UE
  UE 是权威端：
  最终校验目标、距离、资源、冷却、角色状态，
  并负责伤害结算与行为执行。
end note

note bottom of PythonService
  Python 只负责理解、建议与编排，
  不直接修改 UE 战斗数值。
end note

note "端口差异：\n后端文档默认 8000；\nUCommandServiceSubsystem 当前固定 8011；\nUCompanionChatSubsystem 当前固定 8001。\n见 GAP-001 / GAP-002。" as PortGap
PortGap .. UE

legend right
  |= 标记 |= 含义 |
  | 实线 | 当前源码已确认的系统交互 |
  | [证据编号] | 可在 traceability.csv 追溯 |
  | GAP-* | 已发现但尚未裁定的实现差异 |
endlegend

@enduml
